      "message": "Ah, thanks for explaining mForwardedDownstreams parts. I shouldn\u0027t miss that part in the initial review....\n\nI am trying to understand the workflow and still have the following questions\n\nBefore the change,TetherModeAliveState.enter() can trigger `mOffload.start()` and `chooseUpstreamType(true)`. If there are only one IpServer, I think the EVENT_IFACE_SERVING_STATE_ACTIVE will trigger the InitState -\u003e TetherModeAliveState transition. Which seems to me the following logic should be triggered.\n\nAfter the change, if there is no second EVENT_IFACE_SERVING_STATE_ACTIVE event, seems the `mOffload.start()` and `chooseUpstreamType(true)` won\u0027t be triggered?\n\nAm I miss sth.?\n\n\n```\n // TODO: De-duplicate with updateUpstreamWanted() below.\n                if (upstreamWanted()) {\n                    mUpstreamWanted \u003d true;\n                    mOffload.start();\n                    chooseUpstreamType(true);\n                    mTryCell \u003d false;\n                }\n```",
